        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Hello, approaching my first session and I have some doubts.\n\nFirst: it seems to me comic characters spend a lot of times piloting aircrafts. Avengers fly on their Quinjet, the GotG fly (and destroy) a wide range of spaceships, etc.\nI am unable to find a suitable quality for challenges that involve piloting, but before going and making a new one I wanted to check if someone has solved the problem in another way. Maybe using a mix of Alertness and Technology?\n\nSame with the “hotshot pilot” background. I have tried adventurer and military but they don’t seem to fit. I am thinking Hal Jordan here, and military seems more Steve Trevor, while adventurer is more suited to an Indiana Jones type.\nMaybe a mix of the two?\n\nAny idea from more experienced players?",
