        "id": 235928,
        "name": "Dr_Flem",
        "username": "Dr_Flem",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/8797f3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-10T19:02:31.141Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/powerhound_2000\">@Powerhound_2000</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/fjur\">@fjur</a>, lots of good ideas.<br>\nGoing back to my Hal Jordan idea, I think dinasty is the one that works best, with his father being his role model etc.<br>\nStill I wonder why we have military, medical and performer (professional backgrounds) and not pilot/driver, which is a trope in comics. Not complaining, mind you, we can simply add it, just wondering if I am missing something.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-03-10T19:02:31.141Z",
